ucn 0.1 system: Shortly level: L0
# System card: always included in every projection.

goal Share: users share short links that keep working for years
goal Abuse [pin]: the service must not be usable to spread malware or phishing
system Shortly: URL shortening service
  container Web: single-page UI (react)
  container Api: HTTP API for create, resolve, stats (node/express)
  container Db: primary store (postgres)
  container Cache: hot code -> target map (redis)
req Blocklist [security]: IF the target domain is on the blocklist THEN THE system SHALL reject creation with 422
req RateLimit [security, unwanted]: IF a user creates more than 100 links per hour THEN THE system SHALL answer 429
rule Links.CodeImmutable [pin]: a code never changes its target after creation
decision ImmutableCodes [pin]: never retarget an existing code
conflict: Guard.limit is 100/hour (ticket#14) | code uses 1000/hour (api/guard.ts:44)
more: 7 req, 3 actor, 3 component, 2 decision, 3 test -> expand Shortly@L1
